👑🧠 Birbal Counts the Crows (Raw Story)

One day, Emperor Akbar asked Birbal, “How many crows are there in our city?”

Birbal replied quickly, “There are 10,000 crows, Your Majesty.”

Akbar smiled and said, “What if there are more?”

Birbal answered, “Then some crows must have come to visit their relatives.”

Akbar asked again, “What if there are fewer?”

Birbal said, “Then some crows must have gone to visit their relatives elsewhere.”

Akbar laughed at Birbal’s clever answer.

💖 Moral:

A clever mind can find answers to any question.
